Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.56,0:00:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs40\pos(183.2,285.867)}Ghost Meets Gal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.10,0:00:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H16151B&\\3c&HC896B3&\4c&H7473F9&\2c&HD6680A&\pos(68,204.8)}Feltyrosa\NTalent of Enjoyment
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.10,0:00:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, lost little lamb.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Feltyrosa!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.96,0:00:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I enrolled at L.M.\Nbecause I idolize you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.84,0:00:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're a Ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.60,0:00:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.32,0:00:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,One of Feltyrosa's Eleven Attendants
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.82,0:00:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister, who might this girl be?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.82,0:00:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H16151B&\\3c&HC896B3&\4c&H7473F9&\2c&HD6680A&\pos(164,220.8)}Adelheid\NOne of Feltyrosa's \NEleven Attendants
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.82,0:00:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H16151B&\\3c&HC896B3&\4c&H7473F9&\2c&HD6680A&\pos(68.8,224)}Ingrid \NOne of Feltyrosa's \NEleven Attendants
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.48,0:00:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister, weren't you supposed to have tea with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H16151B&\\3c&HC896B3&\4c&H7473F9&\2c&HD6680A&\pos(244,224)}Adelheid\NOne of Feltyrosa's \NEleven Attendants
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H16151B&\\3c&HC896B3&\4c&H7473F9&\2c&HD6680A&\pos(148,224)}Ingrid \NOne of Feltyrosa's \NEleven Attendants
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.26,0:00:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Eek! Sorry, I should get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.14,0:00:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem terribly troubled.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.58,0:00:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.78,0:00:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hopeless at sports,\Nmusic, and academics.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.56,0:00:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried I'll never be able to debut.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.02,0:00:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I can't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.04,0:00:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How presumptuous for a new student\Nto talk about debuting already.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.48,0:00:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back another day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.58,0:00:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:01:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why not become one of my sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.18,0:01:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Whaaa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.34,0:01:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Me? Lady Feltyrosa's?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.96,0:01:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm not worthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.54,0:01:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's such a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.64,0:01:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I'll personally produce you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.50,0:01:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come live in our dorm with me\Nand my sisters, and hone your skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.06,0:01:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean I'd have to\Nleave my current dorm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.66,0:01:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.42,0:01:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's someone I want\Nto work hard alongside.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.16,0:01:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I'll have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.44,0:01:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're turning down Sister's offer?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.40,0:01:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alright, Adelheid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.48,0:01:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, you have no time\Nto waste here on fretting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.72,0:01:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep striving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.00,0:01:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Th-Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.70,0:01:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you possess\Nsomething of value after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.56,0:01:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs25}Looking down, sighing, \Nhiding my true feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.50,0:01:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs25}Every time i step forward, \Neven if i'm trembling,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.86,0:01:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs25}I can't lie to my desire of change!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.70,0:01:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs25}It's surely a distant dream right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.55,0:02:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs25}but i want to chase it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.33,0:02:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs25}Even if our futures are different colors,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.45,0:02:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs25}Let's paint them with the same dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.54,0:02:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs20\pos(189.6,286.933)}Because you are the one who gives me courage!
